        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ace of Rubies is a short adventure alongside the desert highway. You are trapped inside an evil hotel, and must get through the floors to defeat its manager and leave. You will use both sword and magic to fulfil this goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this turn-based RPG, at every turn you can choose to Hit or Stand. If you Hit, your Attack and Magic go up greatly, but your Defense and Agility decrease slightly! If you Stand, the opposite happens! Use this to play with risk-reward during battles, which can end in the blink of an eye!(for better or for worse). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At every floor, you unlock new spells, allowing for new strategies! You can gain powerful damage options or reliable support spells that give you an additional edge over your enemies!</p>",
